                    <section id="ai-intelligence" class="dics-kb-section">
                        <div class="dics-container">
                            <div class="dics-kb-article">
                                <div class="dics-kb-article__head">
                                    <span class="dics-kb-eyebrow">GAME-CHANGING INNOVATION</span>
                                    <h2>1. Embedded AI Intelligence &amp; "Ask Odoo" Natural Language Reporting</h2>
                                </div>
                                <div class="dics-kb-article__body">
                                    <p>
                                        Odoo 19 replaces isolated third-party AI integrations with a unified,
                                        platform-wide Artificial Intelligence engine. Rather than relying on rigid
                                        custom code, business users can now leverage natural language prompts to execute
                                        tasks, generate fields, and extract operational insights directly within the
                                        database.
                                    </p>

                                    <div class="dics-mg-callout dics-mg-callout--note">
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">lightbulb</span>
                                        <div>
                                            <strong>Key Feature: "Ask Odoo" Conversational Analytics</strong>
                                            <p>
                                                Managers and executives no longer need complex pivot table knowledge to
                                                extract reporting metrics. With <em>Ask Odoo</em>, you can ask queries
                                                like <em>"What were our top 5 revenue-generating products in Europe last
                                                quarter?"
                                            </em> and receive tabulated data, charts, and underlying record breakdowns
                                                instantly.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <p>
                                        Key AI enhancements introduced in Odoo 19 include:
                                    </p>
                                    <ul class="dics-kb-list dics-kb-list--good" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                                        <li>
                                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                            <strong>AI Server Actions &amp; Prompts:</strong>
                                            Trigger workflow changes, auto-assign CRM leads, or format follow-up
                                            activities using natural language rules in Odoo Studio.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                            <strong>AI Computed Fields:</strong>
                                            Automatically synthesize product descriptions, summarize customer email
                                            chatter threads, or predict deal probabilities based on historical data.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>
                                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                            <strong>Unified OCR Pipeline:</strong>
                                            A single deep-learning document engine handles vendor bills, expense
                                            receipts, purchase orders, and customer contracts under one automated
                                            learning pipeline.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>




